# Pasting a small outline from the terminal: in navigate mode it goes below the focused task, and into a just-created empty block it replaces that block; undo removes each paste in one step.
file <<END
Work:
	- Report
		Draft due Friday
	- Slides
END
keys j
paste <<END
- Alpha
	- Beta
- Gamma
END
see ▌   - Gamma
see       - Beta
keys z
hide Alpha
see ▌   - Report
keys o
paste <<END
- Alpha
	- Beta
- Gamma
END
see ▌   - Gamma
keys gg j j j
see ▌   - Alpha
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Report
		Draft due Friday
	- Alpha
		- Beta
	- Gamma
	- Slides
END
